<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 100 mln rand bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 100 mln rand bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hambros Bank (books) and Commerzbank AG</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.25     MATURITY    16.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.95    PAY DATE   L15.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    LUX	 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
